 targeting restriction. If the target is tapped before this spell resolves, then this spell doesn’t resolve.","oracle_id":"3db9bf7b-da4e-428f-aa5d-a0cd1afeb16c","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The decision whether or not to tap or untap is made on resolution. This is not a modal spell.","oracle_id":"773ad2ef-5acc-49ea-8d85-056330e87039","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This is not a toggle effect. If you use Twiddle to tap a card and before it takes effect your opponent taps it, Twiddle will not automatically untap the card.","oracle_id":"773ad2ef-5acc-49ea-8d85-056330e87039","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
